/-- `Equation3668` from `Equation2725`: `x = ((y ◇ x) ◇ (z ◇ z)) ◇ y` ⊢ `x ◇ x = (x ◇ y) ◇ (y ◇ y)`, through the
companion `x □ y = if (M.op b a) = b then a else if (M.op b a) = a then b else (M.op b a)`, writing `a`, `b` for `x`, `y`.
